Cell[TextData[{
 "(I couldn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t get Mathematica to solve all 16 component \
equations directly without help. But we know the answer.)\nI currently think \
it\[CloseCurlyQuote]s misleading in Oblak that",
 StyleBox[" f",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " maps SL(2,\[DoubleStruckCapitalC]) to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["O",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8889c044-59a4-4cf6-ace6-d0a2fc1e6016"],
 "(3,1) (eq. (2.26) \[Dash] not even ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["O",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "+"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ce4b99a2-67db-4b9f-9184-3cdc1ae830b1"],
 "). I think it is better to write",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{" ", 
    SuperscriptBox["SO", "+"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f54ede6d-1bb7-4e1d-b9df-89078ce0f6ae"],
 "(3,1). (Of course, since SO \[Element] O, it\[CloseCurlyQuote]s not ",
 StyleBox["wrong",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " to say ",
 StyleBox["f",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " maps to O, just not all of it, i.e. it\[CloseCurlyQuote]s not injective \
[?]. But if you can never get outside SO by ",
 StyleBox["f",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", saying so would be misleading, which I now believe to be the case. Indeed \
on the next page he writes \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["the image of f is contained in the connected Lorentz group ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{" ", 
    SuperscriptBox["SO", "+"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "40cb4d2c-3366-4c46-9db2-bcc1fe3633bd"],
 "(3,1)",
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote].)\n\
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Representation_theory_of_the_Lorentz_group#The_\
covering_group_SL(2,_C)\n\nThe notation ",
 StyleBox["f",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "(",
 StyleBox["S",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ") was useful to exhibit the map from S. But now write ",
 StyleBox["f",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "(",
 StyleBox["S",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ") = \[CapitalLambda]:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9362444066527767`*^9, 3.9362444106398067`*^9}, {
  3.936322527436963*^9, 3.9363225445109158`*^9}, {3.9363229159993773`*^9, 
  3.936322920232874*^9}, {3.936323328153537*^9, 3.936323482486034*^9}, {
  3.93632351708946*^9, 3.936323563315098*^9}, {3.9363236421486607`*^9, 
